    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CONERNEY ESTATE AGENTS are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom own-door apartment to the rental market, superbly located at 6 Dodder Park Drive, Dublin 14\r\nThis newly refurbished apartment coming to market for its FIRST LETTING has its own private entrance (own door apartment) providing the privacy and convenience of a house while benefiting from a highly sought-after residential setting. \r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, with hardwood refurbished flooring and new appliances the apartment is wired for high-speed internet and the landlord will supply new beds, bed side lockers, wardrobes and living room couch as required (or leave it unfurnished if that suits you better)\r\nThe fully fitted kitchen comes complete with all essential appliances, including an oven, hob, dishwasher, extractor fan, fridge freezer and separate room for the washing machine and dryer.\r\nThere are two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both offering excellent natural light. The contemporary main bathroom is finished with modern fittings and features a large walk-in shower.\r\nLocated in the highly desirable Dodder Park area of Dublin 14, this apartment enjoys excellent access to a wide range of local amenities, including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, parks, and leisure facilities. The nearby villages of Rathfarnham, Churchtown and Milltown, together with Dundrum Town Centre, offer an excellent selection of retail and dining options.\r\nThe location is exceptionally well connected, with regular Dublin Bus services, the LUAS Green Line within easy reach, and convenient access to the M50 and Dublin city centre.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to rent a modern home in one of South Dublin's most convenient residential locations. Viewing is highly recommended. Please apply online and we will contact you to arrange the next available viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1"
      }
